1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:06,640
If you're not willing to hold the candidates that you want to win to any standard of ethics,

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:12,900
then I don't know what you think they're going to do when they win.

3
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:27,660
Because you've already shown them that they can just do the opposite of what you have demanded of them and still get your support.

4
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:33,070
Now, for the record, y'all know I don't even believe in electoral politics.

5
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:36,270
What I do believe in is the people.

6
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:45,990
And it is quite disheartening to watch people who I know are smart, who I know are principled,

7
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:52,970
continuously fall prey to establishment politics.

8
00:00:52,970 --> 00:01:08,520
Instead of demanding that the folks that they support be deeply and solidly against capitulating to it.

9
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:11,940
Get your energy right.

10
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:15,720
Come and join me, Amanda Seals, this Wednesday, August 12th,

11
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:19,620
and every second Wednesday at Comedy in Harlem for Radical Rhythms Experience.

12
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:25,000
Every month we come together to level up our vibration with music, humor, and each other.

